3. SCOPE
--------
- MIT: everything needed to run your own Lokma harness locally or on your
  own servers from this repository's source.
- Proprietary: the operator's hosted instance, its domain/TLS/auth wiring,
  credentials, and user data.

See Docs/02-TEKNIK-KARARLAR.md (License row) for the original decision.
